    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "“Atlantic View” is an exceptional five-bedroom cottage dating back to 1919, beautifully restored, upgraded, and renovated to an outstanding standard while retaining its original charm and character. Set on an elevated 0.46-acre site, the property enjoys a truly spectacular setting with uninterrupted views overlooking Roscahill Pier, Croagh Patrick, and the ever-changing surrounding landscape. Every aspect of the home reflects quality craftsmanship and thoughtful attention to detail, creating bright, welcoming interiors filled with warmth and character.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation begins with an inviting entrance lobby, perfectly framed by a large picture window capturing the stunning coastal scenery beyond. At the heart of the home, the spacious living room features oak flooring and a solid fuel stove with back boiler, providing a cosy and comfortable focal point. Two generously proportioned double bedrooms are positioned to the front of the property, each benefiting from timber flooring and breathtaking panoramic views. To the rear, the kitchen and dining area is fitted with cream cabinetry and offers a practical yet charming family space. The property further comprises a wet room, a separate bathroom complete with a sunken bath, and three additional bedrooms, all finished with timber flooring.\r\n\r\nExternally, “Atlantic View” is equally impressive. Mature trees and shrubbery, together with low-maintenance timber fencing, provide privacy and shelter, while the beautifully landscaped gardens are awash with colour and carefully maintained throughout the seasons. An adjoining garage with roller door offers excellent storage, complemented by an additional utility shed housing laundry appliances and a further storage shed to the rear.\r\n\r\nCombining timeless character, modern comforts, and one of the most picturesque settings imaginable, “Atlantic View” presents a rare opportunity to acquire a truly special home where tranquility, scenery, and lifestyle come together effortlessly. Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all this remarkable property has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
